# SU / SD — ECMA-48 §8.3.147 / §8.3.113: scroll the region up (down) by Ps
# rows. Only the rows between the margins move; blank rows open at the
# opposite margin and nothing enters the scrollback. The cursor stays put.
# After "cc" the screen holds TOP / aa / bb / cc / BOTTOM; SU drops "aa",
# then SD 2 pushes what remains back down, leaving only "bb" at row 3.
TOP
\e[5;1HBOTTOM
\e[2;4r\e[2;1H
aa\r\nbb\r\ncc
\e[S
\e[2T
